# TriGuide-AI core

- Goal: Android AI navigation + virtual three-wheel steering for visually impaired users.
- Phone is the brain; **no physical robot hardware** unless the user explicitly asks.
- Prefer MediaPipe / on-device ML; research OpenBot, GuideLens concepts, Project Guideline before inventing.
- After each phase: build/test, fix failures, document in `docs/PROGRESS.md` and `docs/KNOWN_ISSUES.md`.
- Never report unrun tests as passed. Ask the user only for approvals, USB/phone actions, or account login.
